      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been trying out that box breathing thing (4 in, 4 hold, 4 out, 4 hold) to help with stress. can you explain what's actually happening in my body when i do that? like, how does it affect my nervous system or cortisol?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
